{"text":"Four, do not underestimate the power of writing your dreams and goals down. Right before I got cast in 12 Years a Slave, I wrote in my diary what kind of work I wanted to do. I envisioned, this was on May 4th, 2012, that I wanted to make meaningful films that affect change in people's understanding of and commitment to the world we live in. I also wrote that I wanted to visit New Orleans for a week. On May 13th, I booked 12 Years a Slave, and on June 6th, I would be in Louisiana working on the film for five weeks. Five, breathe, meditate, pray, be still with your soul. There is a force within us that surrounds us, penetrates us, and binds us together, and I'm not just saying that because I'm in Star Wars. I believe it.","words":[{"text":"Four","start":0.0,"end":0.84,"punct":","},{"text":"do","start":1.8,"end":1.92},{"text":"not","start":1.92,"end":2.16},{"text":"underestimate","start":2.16,"end":2.86},{"text":"the","start":2.86,"end":3.16},{"text":"power","start":3.16,"end":3.52},{"text":"of","start":3.52,"end":3.82},{"text":"writing","start":3.82,"end":4.18},{"text":"your","start":4.18,"end":4.5},{"text":"dreams","start":4.5,"end":4.9},{"text":"and","start":4.9,"end":5.3},{"text":"goals","start":5.3,"end":5.58},{"text":"down","start":5.58,"end":6.04,"punct":"."},{"text":"Right","start":7.4,"end":7.58},{"text":"before","start":7.58,"end":7.84},{"text":"I","start":7.84,"end":8.02},{"text":"got","start":8.02,"end":8.2},{"text":"cast","start":8.2,"end":8.56},{"text":"in","start":8.56,"end":8.76},{"text":"12","start":8.76,"end":9.0},{"text":"Years","start":9.0,"end":9.2},{"text":"a","start":9.2,"end":9.42},{"text":"Slave","start":9.42,"end":9.64,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":9.96,"end":10.18},{"text":"wrote","start":10.18,"end":10.42},{"text":"in","start":10.42,"end":10.62},{"text":"my","start":10.62,"end":10.82},{"text":"diary","start":10.82,"end":11.28},{"text":"what","start":11.28,"end":12.2},{"text":"kind","start":12.2,"end":12.42},{"text":"of","start":1